    "Description":  "Flight-log-calibrated UH-60L profile for the latest DCS Extra Telemetry plugin. Adds control-response modulation to all rotor harmonics, a restrained engine-governor load layer, and a revised maneuver body cue led by maneuver and control response with subordinate vertical-speed context. Capability-gated lifecycle, powertrain, aerodynamic, ground, and weapon effects; retain 50% global gain for first test.",
